                                'Sensibilidad de dirección',
                                style: TextStyle(fontSize: 13, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold, color: Colors.white),
                              ),
                              Container(
                                padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 8, vertical: 3),
                                decoration: BoxDecoration(
                                  color: const Color(0x3300E5FF),
                                  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                                  border: Border.all(color: const Color(0xFF00E5FF)),
                                ),
                                child: Text(
                                  '$sensPct% • $sensDesc',
                                  style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 11, fontWeight: FontWeight.w900, color: Color(0xFF80F4FF)),
                                ),
                              ),
                            ],
                          ),
                          SliderTheme(
                            data: SliderTheme.of(dialogCtx).copyWith(
                              activeTrackColor: const Color(0xFF00E5FF),
                              inactiveTrackColor: const Color(0xFF2A364F),
                              thumbColor: Colors.white,
                              overlayColor: const Color(0x3300E5FF),
